          "description": "USE THIS whenever the user asks you to build, produce or suggest a decklist. Build a tournament-legal deck (40-60 Main, up to 15 Extra, 15 Side) that respects the banlist of the chosen format (TCG, OCG, AE, Genesys, Master Duel), with strategy, staples and a legal list. Every generated list is re-validated (banlist, sizes, Extra Deck placement) before it is returned. If the archetype has no template the tool returns available:false plus availableArchetypes — it never substitutes another deck. Never output a decklist from memory; every card must come from this tool",
